   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,580:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 5.4 Phase 3: Behavioral Sequence Testing
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,586:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: SEQ rules detect multi-step attack patterns that single-payload analysis cannot catch: reading a sensitive file
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: followed by exfiltration, writing to agent configuration files, or credential access followed by MCP tool calls.
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,587:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Evaluation approach:
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,588:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,589:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: 4 baseline tests verify that known-bad sequences trigger the expected rules
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,589:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
