   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,590:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: l
   DEBUG: 2026-03-23 16:11:23,591:      pdf_renderer.py:  470: printSegment: Each evasion vector targets a specific architectural constraint documented in the attacker briefing
